{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1988, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$1$", "explanation": "只需考查 $x=0$ 处连续性。左值为 $a$，右极限为 $1$，故 $a=1$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1988, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$(2t+1)e^{2t}$", "explanation": "由\n$$\n\\left(1+\\dfrac{1}{x}\\right)^x\\to e\n$$\n可得\n$$\nf(t)=t\\left[\\left(1+\\dfrac{1}{x}\\right)^x\\right]^{2t}\\to te^{2t}.\n$$\n因此\n$$\nf'(t)=e^{2t}+2te^{2t}=(2t+1)e^{2t}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1988, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["变上限积分", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{12}$", "explanation": "对等式求导得 $f(x^3-1)\\cdot 3x^2=1$。令 $x^3-1=7$，则 $x=2$，故 $f(7)=1/12$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1988, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$1$", "explanation": "取对数，得 $\\tan x\\ln x^{-1/2}$。由 $\\tan x\\sim x$ 且 $x\\ln x\\to0$，可知对数趋于 $0$，故原极限为 $1$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1988, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "换元"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$2(e^2+1)$", "explanation": "令 $u=\\sqrt{x}$，则积分化为 $2\\int_0^2ue^u\\,du$，计算得 $2(e^2+1)$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1988, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 20, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数应用", "切线方程", "连续性", "微分", "旋转体体积", "微分方程", "极值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "(1) A；(2) C；(3) B；(4) B；(5) A", "explanation": "(1) $f'(0)=6$，故切线为 $y=6x+1$，与 $x$ 轴交于 $\\left(-\\frac{1}{6},0\\right)$，选 A。\n\n(2) 因 $f,g$ 可导，所以连续。由 $f(x)<g(x)$ 可得对任意 $x_0$，\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to x_0}f(x)=f(x_0)<g(x_0)=\\lim_{x\\to x_0}g(x),\n$$\n选 C。\n\n(3) $dy=f'(x_0)\\Delta x+o(\\Delta x)$，且 $f'(x_0)=\\frac{1}{2}\\ne0$，所以 $dy$ 与 $\\Delta x$ 同阶，选 B。\n\n(4) 旋转体体积为\n$$\nV=\\pi\\int_0^\\pi y^2\\,dx\n=\\pi\\int_0^\\pi \\sin^3 x\\,dx\n=\\frac{4\\pi}{3},\n$$\n选 B。\n\n(5) 由方程得 $f''(x_0)-2f'(x_0)+4f(x_0)=0$。已知 $f'(x_0)=0$ 且 $f(x_0)>0$，故\n$$\nf''(x_0)=-4f(x_0)<0,\n$$\n所以 $f$ 在 $x_0$ 处有极大值，选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1988, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "solution", "score": 15, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["反函数", "隐函数", "微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "(1) $\\varphi(x)=\\sqrt{\\ln(1-x)}$，定义域为 $(-\\infty,0)$；(2) $y'\\big|_{x=0}=1$，$y''\\big|_{x=0}=2$；(3) $y=\\dfrac{1}{x}(\\arctan x+C)$", "explanation": "第一问由 $e^{[\\varphi(x)]^2}=1-x$ 得出。第二问对隐式方程两次求导并在 $x=0$ 处代入。第三问的一阶线性方程积分因子为 $x$。", "methods": ["积分因子"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1988", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1988, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "solution", "score": 37, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["函数作图", "最值", "积分", "积分中值定理"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1988_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1988_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "(1) 单调增区间 $(-\\infty,1)$，单调减区间 $(1,+\\infty)$，极值点 $x=1$，极值 $2$，凹区间 $(-\\infty,0)\\cup(2,+\\infty)$，凸区间 $(0,2)$，拐点 $(0,3/2)$、$(2,3/2)$，渐近线 $y=0$；(2) 圆的周长 $\\dfrac{\\pi a}{4+\\pi}$，正方形的周长 $\\dfrac{4a}{4+\\pi}$；(3) $y=(1-2x)e^{2x}$；(4) 当 $-1\\le x<0$ 时为 $\\dfrac{1}{2}(1+x)^2$，当 $x\\ge0$ 时为 $1-\\dfrac{1}{2}(1-x)^2$；(5) 极限为 $f'(0)$，且不等式成立。", "explanation": "第一问用一、二阶导数分析。第二问把面积和写成一元二次函数。第三问解常系数线性方程并用初始条件确定常数。第四问按 $x<0$ 与 $x\\ge0$ 分段积分。第五问用积分中值定理与有界估计。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
